							"cost_adj": "-20%"
						},
						{
							"id": "moqHc6ZhEpTPaS6lS",
							"name": "Accessibility (only affects psykers and other warp-sensitive minds)",
							"cost_adj": "-20%"
						}
					],
					"base_points": 10
				},
				{
					"id": "tBpbmSCYPcIa11b5u",
					"name": "Injury Tolerance (Damage Reduction)",
					"reference": "P53",
					"local_notes": "Divisor 2 (level = divisor): after DR and wounding multipliers, all injury is divided by 2 (round down, minimum 1 if anything penetrated).\n\nLore: A Lictor's dense, sinewy body keeps stalking through wounds. Large synapse-beasts and monsters shrug off wounds that would fell smaller creatures.\n\nDesign: Injury Tolerance (Damage Reduction) (GURPS Powers p. 53, 25 points per level, level = divisor): divisor 2 = 50 points. Gives the Lictor the bulk-and-redundant-organs toughness the lore describes on top of its chitin DR and extra HP.",
					"tags": [
						"Advantage",
						"Physical",
