					"reference": "P53",
					"local_notes": "Divisor 3 (level = divisor): after DR and wounding multipliers, all injury is divided by 3 (round down, minimum 1 if anything penetrated).\n\nLore: A Carnifex is a mountain of muscle and redundant organs that simply does not stop. Large synapse-beasts and monsters shrug off wounds that would fell smaller creatures.\n\nDesign: Injury Tolerance (Damage Reduction) (GURPS Powers p. 53, 25 points per level, level = divisor): divisor 3 = 75 points. Gives the Carnifex the bulk-and-redundant-organs toughness the lore describes on top of its chitin DR and extra HP.",
